  "content": "\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration/network/members\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration/stargazers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinkedin.com%252fin%252fkit-lehto\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-LinkedIn-black.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=linkedin&colorB=555\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fzmkyJa3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1032138561618726952?logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge&label=Discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration?label=Modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"192\" height=\"28\"></a></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>BlueMap 自訂皮膚伺服器：Fabric Tailor 整合</strong>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">由於技術問題，原已整合至 BlueMap 自訂皮膚伺服器的 Fabric Tailor 功能已獨立為模組</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">使用技術</h3>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/fabric api-DBD0B4?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/fabric language kotlin-7F52FF?style=for-the-badge&logo=kotlin&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ducky updater lib-1bd96a?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/bluemap-2c84e4?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>使用方法</h2>\n<p>安裝後，請前往 <strong>BlueMap 自訂皮膚伺服器</strong> 的設定檔，將 <code>integration</code> 的值替換為 <code>bluemap-custom-skin-server-fabric-tailor-integration:fabric-tailor</code></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">貢獻</h3>\n<p>正是各位的貢獻讓開放原始碼社群成為學習、啟發與創造的絕佳之處。您的任何貢獻都將受到<strong>高度感謝</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您有更好的建議，歡迎 Fork 此專案並建立 Pull Request。您也可以直接開啟帶有「enhancement」標籤的 Issue。別忘了給專案點個 Star！再次感謝！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fork 此專案</li>\n<li>建立新功能分支 (<code>git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature</code>)</li>\n<li>提交更改 (<code>git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'</code>)</li>\n<li>推送到分支 (<code>git push origin feature/AmazingFeature</code>)</li>\n<li>開啟 Pull Request</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">授權條款</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本專案採用 MIT 授權條款釋出。如需更多資訊，請參閱 <strong><code>LICENSE.txt</code></strong>。</p>",
